{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "依次把数组元素与累计值做异或：相同数字异或后变成 0，而 0 与任何数字异或仍是它本身。示例 [4,1,2,1,2] 扫描结束后，成对出现的 1 和 2 被抵消，只留下 4。整个过程只遍历一次数组，并且只维护一个累计值，因此时间复杂度为 O(n)，额外空间复杂度为 O(1)。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>只出现一次的数字：异或过程</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.rule{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.accent{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.muted{color:#8d8d8d}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}\n.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.array,.chars,.row-wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.cell,.char,.num-cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:.3s}\n.cell .idx,.char .index,.index,.marker{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px;font-weight:400}\n.cell.active,.cell.mid,.cell.current,.cell.found,.cell.max,.char.active,.num-cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.out,.cell.discarded{opacity:.35}\n.card{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30}\n.card-label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n.card-value{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.progress{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.dot,.pill{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#3c3c3c;transition:background .3s}\n.dot.on,.pill.on{background:#3794ff}\n.pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.pills .pill{flex:none;height:auto;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;color:#8d8d8d}\n.pills .pill.active,.pills .pill.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.status{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45;min-height:auto}\n\n.calc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:6px;margin-top:6px}\n.number{font-size:13px;color:#3794ff;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:700}\n.binary{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;margin-top:2px}\n.equation{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px}\n.explain{margin-top:6px;font-size:12px;min-height:32px}\n.progress .dot{flex:none;height:auto;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;background:#2d2d30}\n.progress .dot.current{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.progress .dot.done{border-color:#3794ff;color:#3794ff}\n.result{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30;transition:.35s}\n.result.ready{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.result-value{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-left:4px}\n.rules{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:8px}\n.rules .rule{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n@media(max-width:520px){.calc-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.rules{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n\n.cell .pointer{visibility:hidden;font-size:10px;white-space:nowrap;min-height:14px}.cell.active .pointer{visibility:visible;color:#fff}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>异或抵消成对数字</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">示例 <span class=\"mono\">nums = [4, 1, 2, 1, 2]</span>，acc 从 0 开始。</p>\n<section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"panel-title\">当前扫描</div><div class=\"array\" id=\"array\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"panel-title\">更新 acc</div>\n<div class=\"calc-grid\">\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-label\">acc 前</div><div class=\"number\" id=\"before\">0</div><div class=\"binary\" id=\"beforeBinary\">000</div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-label\">nums[i]</div><div class=\"number\" id=\"current\">4</div><div class=\"binary\" id=\"currentBinary\">100</div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-label\">acc 后</div><div class=\"number\" id=\"after\">4</div><div class=\"binary\" id=\"afterBinary\">100</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"equation\" id=\"equation\">0 XOR 4 = 4</div>\n<div class=\"explain\" id=\"explain\">读入 4，累计值由 0 变为 4。</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" id=\"progress\"></div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"result\" id=\"result\">唯一数字<span class=\"result-value\" id=\"resultValue\">?</span></div>\n<div class=\"rules\"><div class=\"rule\"><code class=\"mono accent\">x XOR x = 0</code><br>相同数抵消</div><div class=\"rule\"><code class=\"mono accent\">x XOR 0 = x</code><br>留下唯一数</div></div>\n</main>\n<script>\n\n(function () {\n  const nums = [4, 1, 2, 1, 2];\n  const states = [];\n  let acc = 0;\n  nums.forEach((value, index) => {\n    const before = acc;\n    acc ^= value;\n    states.push({ index, value, before, after: acc });\n  });\n\n  const array = document.getElementById('array');\n  const progress = document.getElementById('progress');\n\n  nums.forEach((value, index) => {\n    const cell = document.createElement('div');\n    cell.className = 'cell';\n    cell.innerHTML = '<div class=\"value\">' + value + '</div><div class=\"index\">下标 ' + index + '</div><div class=\"pointer\">当前 i</div>';\n    array.appendChild(cell);\n\n    const dot = document.createElement('div');\n    dot.className = 'dot';\n    dot.textContent = '第 ' + (index + 1) + ' 步';\n    progress.appendChild(dot);\n  });\n\n  function bits(n) {\n    return (n >>> 0).toString(2).padStart(3, '0').slice(-3);\n  }\n\n  function explanation(s) {\n    if (s.index === 0) return '读入 4，累计值由 0 变为 4。';\n    if (s.index === 1) return '读入第一个 1，先把它保留在累计值中。';\n    if (s.index === 2) return '读入第一个 2，此时 1 和 2 都还没有遇到配对。';\n    if (s.index === 3) return '第二个 1 到来，与先前的 1 异或抵消。';\n    return '第二个 2 到来，与先前的 2 异或抵消，最终只剩 4。';\n  }\n\n  function render(step) {\n    const s = states[step];\n    document.querySelectorAll('.cell').forEach((cell, i) => cell.classList.toggle('active', i === step));\n    document.querySelectorAll('.dot').forEach((dot, i) => {\n      dot.classList.toggle('done', i < step);\n      dot.classList.toggle('current', i === step);\n    });\n    document.getElementById('before').textContent = s.before;\n    document.getElementById('current').textContent = s.value;\n    document.getElementById('after').textContent = s.after;\n    document.getElementById('beforeBinary').textContent = bits(s.before);\n    document.getElementById('currentBinary').textContent = bits(s.value);\n    document.getElementById('afterBinary').textContent = bits(s.after);\n    document.getElementById('equation').textContent = s.before + ' XOR ' + s.value + ' = ' + s.after;\n    document.getElementById('explain').textContent = explanation(s);\n    const finished = step === states.length - 1;\n    document.getElementById('result').classList.toggle('ready', finished);\n    document.getElementById('resultValue').textContent = finished ? s.after : '?';\n  }\n\n  let step = 0;\n  render(step);\n  setInterval(function () {\n    step = (step + 1) % states.length;\n    render(step);\n  }, 1900);\n})();\n\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
